The Fleshforming Clinic has made an exact, washable island inside the Goblin
Market's rough construction. A narrow `wtreatment table`x occupies the cleared
space, backed by fittings whose clean edges are almost too conspicuous beside
the uneven walls. The surrounding joinery refuses to match the clinical
surfaces. The contrast gives the room an unsettling precision, as though the
care spent preparing it says little about whether the purpose should be
comforting.`x
