#405086
the Mobious path~
The `wpath`x repeats with the stubborn familiarity of a dream revisited. A
worn patch of ground, a bend in the enclosing shapes, another stretch that
seems already passed: none offers a reliable landmark. It's all perfectly
visible at close range, yet difficult to place in a sequence that makes sense.
The exposed edges are rounded more heavily on one side than the other. The
immediate ground is clearest through the middle, where ordinary passage has
kept the margins at bay.`x
